- Glutsch V et al. (Acta Derm Venereol, 2020; doi:10.2340/00015555-3526; PubMed: 32449784). Indirect comparison in melanoma patients with elevated baseline LDH across co-BRIM (vemurafenib+cobimetinib), COMBI-v (dabrafenib+trametinib), and COLUMBUS Part 1 (Enco+Bini). Using Bucher method, found a non-significant risk reduction for progression favoring vemurafenib+cobimetinib vs the other combinations; offers guidance for high-LDH subgroups with the caveat of indirect analyses.

