- Ascierto PA et al. (Eur J Cancer, 2020; doi:10.1016/j.ejca.2019.11.016; PubMed: 31901705). Updated long-term analysis of COLUMBUS: Enco+Bini vs vemurafenib or encorafenib in BRAF V600–mutant melanoma. Confirms established PFS and OS advantages of BRAF/MEK combination therapy and provides extended tolerability and survival data with longer follow-up.

