- Title: COT drives resistance to RAF inhibition through MAP kinase pathway reactivation.
- Authors: Johannessen CM; Boehm JS; Kim SY; Thomas SR; Wardwell L; Johnson LA; Emery CM; Stransky N; Cogdill AP; Barretina J; Caponigro G; Hieronymus H; Murray RR; Salehi-Ashtiani K; Hill DE; Vidal M; Zhao JJ; Yang X; Alkan O; Kim S; Harris JL; Wilson CJ; Myer VE; Finan PM; Root DE; Roberts TM; Golub T; Flaherty KT; Dummer R; Weber BL; Sellers WR; Schlegel R; Wargo JA; Hahn WC; Garraway LA
- DOI: 10.1038/nature09627
- Published date: 2010-01-01
- Updated date: 2010-01-01
- URL: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21107320/
- PDF URL: (not provided)
- Source: PubMed
- Categories: (not provided)
- Keywords: (not provided)
- Citations: 0
- References: (not provided)
