  - Operating hours: Daily via commercial ferry (Alcatraz City Cruises; 415-981-7625; alcatrazcitycruises.com). Hours vary seasonally; example listing shows 9:00 AM–9:30 PM most days, 9:00 AM–6:30 PM Sun/Mon. Closed Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year’s Day. Tickets sell out; reserve up to 90 days ahead. Visitors may stay until last ferry.
  - Contacts: Phone 415-561-4900; Email goga_alca_socialmedia@nps.gov
  - Images: Available (lighthouse/island views, cellhouse, historic photos).

- Butterfield Overland National Historic Trail (code: buov)
  - States: MO, AR, OK, TX, NM, AZ, CA | URL: https://www.nps.gov/buov/index.htm | Designation: National Historic Trail
  - Description: 1857 overland mail and passenger/freight route across the southern U.S.; stagecoaches departed twice weekly.
