  - Weather: Varies by region along long corridor; check local NWS forecasts (weather.gov).
  - Location: 32.2768237589, -106.796583304
  - Entrance fees: None listed (varies by site).
  - Operating hours: Not a signed hiking trail; corridor across mixed ownerships. Hours/access vary by site; contact locations before visiting. Standard hours listed as “All Day.”
