- Night sky: Astronomy, Stargazing
- Camping: Backcountry, Front-country/Car, Horse/Stock, Group, RV
- Caving
- Climbing: Rock climbing
- Fishing: Freshwater, Fly fishing
- Food: Dining, Picnicking
- Guided/Hands-on: Guided tours, Citizen science
- Hiking: Front-country and backcountry
- Equestrian: Horse trekking, Horseback riding
- Youth: Junior Ranger
- Winter: Cross-country skiing, Snow play, Snowshoeing
- Wildlife: Wildlife watching, Birdwatching
- Exhibits/Media: Park film, Museum exhibits
- Shopping: Bookstore/Park store, Gift shop/Souvenirs

