- Entrance pass:
  - Annual Entrance – Park: $55.00. Valid 12 months from purchase; covers pass signee and accompanying passengers in a single, non-commercial vehicle. Available at entrance stations and visitor centers.
- Operating hours: Open 24/7/365. Visitation increases in fall, peaks during spring wildflowers, decreases in summer heat. Some areas are day-use only. Visitor centers have separate hours.
- Topics: Archeology; Farming and Agriculture; Ranches; Industry; Mining; Native American Heritage; Westward Expansion; Homesteading; Animals; Birds; Tortoises and Turtles; Climate Change; Geology; Groundwater; Freshwater Springs; Night Sky; Trails; Unique Species; Endangered; Wilderness.
