Tool `NixOS:darwin_options_by_prefix` with Parameter {'option_prefix': 'homebrew'} on NixOS succeeded. Result (summarized from 1558 tokens): Here’s a concise summary of nix-darwin options with the homebrew prefix, grouped by area:

Core/Homebrew setup
- homebrew.enable: Enable nix-darwin to manage Homebrew taps, formulae, casks, MAS apps, and whalebrew via Brewfile.
- homebrew.user: User account that owns the Homebrew installation (usually your normal user).
- homebrew.brewPrefix: Path prefix where the brew executable is located; auto-detected per platform, override if using a custom install path.
- homebrew.extraConfig: Extra lines to append verbatim to the generated Brewfile.

Taps
- homebrew.taps: List of Homebrew repositories to tap.
- homebrew.taps.*.name: GitHub tap name (user/repo); taps https://github.com/user/homebrew-repo via HTTPS if clone_target is not set.
- homebrew.taps.*.clone_target: Clone tap from any git location/protocol (not just GitHub).
- homebrew.taps.*.force_auto_update: Auto-update the tap even if not hosted on GitHub (off by default for performance).

Formulae (brews)
- homebrew.brews: List of formulae to install.
- homebrew.brews.*.name: Formula name.
- homebrew.brews.*.args: Flags for brew install (omit leading “--”).
- homebrew.brews.*.conflicts_with: Formulae to unlink and stop services for (if installed).
- homebrew.brews.*.link: Whether to link into Homebrew prefix; null uses Homebrew defaults.
- homebrew.brews.*.start_service: Run brew services start and register at login/boot.
- homebrew.brews.*.restart_service: Run brew services restart and register at login/boot; "changed" only restarts on version changes.

Casks
- homebrew.casks: List of casks to install.
- homebrew.casks.*.name: Cask name.
- homebrew.casks.*.args: Per-cask args for brew install --cask (same keys as caskArgs).
- homebrew.casks.*.greedy: Always upgrade this cask (even if unversioned/self-updating).
- homebrew.greedyCasks: Global: always upgrade all listed casks.

Cask arguments (defaults for all casks unless overridden per cask)
- homebrew.caskArgs: Global args for brew install --cask.
- caskArgs.appdir: Target Applications directory.
- caskArgs.audio_unit_plugindir: Audio Unit Plugins dir.
- caskArgs.colorpickerdir: Color Pickers dir.
- caskArgs.dictionarydir: Dictionaries dir.
- caskArgs.fontdir: Fonts dir.
- caskArgs.ignore_dependencies: Ignore cask dependencies (if managed externally).
- caskArgs.input_methoddir: Input Methods dir.
- caskArgs.internet_plugindir: Internet Plugins dir.
- caskArgs.language: Comma-separated preferred language codes; first match used; defaults to system language.
- caskArgs.mdimporterdir: Spotlight Plugins dir.
- caskArgs.no_binaries: Disable linking of helper executables.
- caskArgs.no_quarantine: Disable download quarantine.
- caskArgs.prefpanedir: Preference Panes dir.
- caskArgs.qlplugindir: QuickLook Plugins dir.
- caskArgs.require_sha: Require checksum for cask(s).
- caskArgs.screen_saverdir: Screen Savers dir.
- caskArgs.servicedir: Services dir.
- caskArgs.vst3_plugindir: VST3 Plugins dir.
- caskArgs.vst_plugindir: VST Plugins dir.

Global behavior when you manually run brew commands
- homebrew.global: Options affecting manual invocations.
- homebrew.global.autoUpdate: Auto-update Homebrew and formulae on manual brew install/upgrade/tap/bundle.
- homebrew.global.brewfile: Auto-use the generated Brewfile from the Nix store when you run brew bundle manually.
- homebrew.global.lockfiles: Generate lockfiles when you run brew bundle [install] manually.

Activation-time behavior (when nix-darwin runs brew bundle)
- homebrew.onActivation: Controls brew bundle during system activation.
- homebrew.onActivation.autoUpdate: Auto-update Homebrew/formulae during activation (default false for idempotency).
- homebrew.onActivation.upgrade: Upgrade outdated formulae and MAS apps during activation (default false for idempotency).
- homebrew.onActivation.cleanup: Manage items installed by Homebrew but not in the generated Brewfile (e.g., remove/uninstall).
- homebrew.onActivation.extraFlags: Extra flags for brew bundle [install] during act
