2025-12-01 11:21:37,343 - benchmark.results_formatter - INFO -         The agent exclusively used the Weather Data tool (and a time lookup) even though the task called for multiple data sources (elevation, pedestrian counts, delivery distances, curb management). For the weather subtask, the tool choice was perfect (100% appropriate for that piece), but for the other four subtasks no appropriate tools were invoked (0% coverage). That yields about 50% overall appropriateness when averaged across the five subtasks → tool_appropriateness score 5.
