     [−0.33333333,  0.48717949, −0.17948718],
     [ 0.66666667, −0.28205128,  0.05128205]]
  - Checks (numerical roundoff only): A·A⁻¹ ≈ I₃ and A⁻¹·A ≈ I₃.

References (for verification)
- Moore–Penrose inverse: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moore–Penrose_inverse
- SVD and pseudoinverse construction: Golub & Van Loan, Matrix Computations, 4th ed., Sections on SVD and pseudoinverses.
